    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/6c4da680a53b4f179439b25b0c09cb7e.webp?t=1750623965\" width=693 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/f5fa326dfed4c47ebf25946a6c0cf5f4.avif?t=1750623965\" width=614 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You awake inside a decaying complex, confused and alone. A nearby laptop flickers to life, revealing a fascinating ability - <strong>whatever is written in it becomes reality.</strong> With this unique tool, you must navigate the enigmatic Sensoria Komplex, using your <strong>creativity</strong> and <strong>intuition</strong> to <strong>uncover its secrets</strong> and <strong>find a way out.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/969a22065df66c065cfddb1c482aa650.avif?t=1750623965\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/62fe782b62263619f8d868ed8a1913e1.poster.avif?t=1750623965\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/62fe782b62263619f8d868ed8a1913e1.webm?t=1750623965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/62fe782b62263619f8d868ed8a1913e1.mp4?t=1750623965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/7629d2e0765b7d29dd278ae382fe698b.webp?t=1750623965\" width=616 height=52 /></span><strong>Multiple paths</strong> await as you explore the sprawling Sensoria Komplex. Its abstract and unpredictable halls have many <strong>secrets</strong>, some charming, some dangerous. Its haunting soundscape creates a unique, <strong>immersive atmosphere</strong>. Your <strong>choices </strong>will affect this living world, and will decide whether you <strong>uncover its secrets</strong> or stay within its blood-soaked walls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/c2f635ba1d5f8d663f905a27d7c64e02.poster.avif?t=1750623965\" width=693 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/c2f635ba1d5f8d663f905a27d7c64e02.webm?t=1750623965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/969a22065df66c065cfddb1c482aa650.avif?t=1750623965\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/d89ee7d9a75c2979eb5b804e5d485e9d.poster.avif?t=1750623965\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/d89ee7d9a75c2979eb5b804e5d485e9d.webm?t=1750623965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/d89ee7d9a75c2979eb5b804e5d485e9d.mp4?t=1750623965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/59595076ef3c6624fc426437517e8ec6.webp?t=1750623965\" width=616 height=52 /></span><i>SYNTAXIA features an <strong>open-ended puzzle design</strong>, where <strong>problems have many solutions</strong>. Why settle for just one way? The <strong>only limit is your creativity</strong>. Want to get through a door? Find a heavy object and break it down\u2014or maybe there's a window you can open instead. <strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>experiment</strong>, and <strong>discover your own path.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/969a22065df66c065cfddb1c482aa650.avif?t=1750623965\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/8e4b7db6a57db9fb82691c57b5d6ffbb.poster.avif?t=1750623965\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/8e4b7db6a57db9fb82691c57b5d6ffbb.webm?t=1750623965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/8e4b7db6a57db9fb82691c57b5d6ffbb.mp4?t=1750623965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/8e4197d84f7e991700b1d5b2520d9c69.webp?t=1750623965\" width=616 height=52 /></span><i>The Sensoria Komplex brims with <strong>hidden dangers</strong>, where shadows twist with malice and unseen threats lurk. <strong>Trust your intuition</strong>\u2014follow it, and let the subtle pull of your instincts lead the way. Amidst this darkness, however, <strong>pockets of comfort can be found</strong>: a crackling fire, the soothing patter of rain on distant windows. Embrace these peaceful moments, wrap yourself in these moments of coziness, and <strong>guard your sanity</strong> like a fragile flame in the night.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/969a22065df66c065cfddb1c482aa650.avif?t=1750623965\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/94e48cad98f9dc7c3375b640c3294bc6.poster.avif?t=1750623965\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/94e48cad98f9dc7c3375b640c3294bc6.webm?t=1750623965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/94e48cad98f9dc7c3375b640c3294bc6.mp4?t=1750623965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/2e4b9156d72da8b8d7bcb16435977676.webp?t=1750623965\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The <strong>world is hand-crafted,</strong> <strong>charming</strong>, and <strong>detailed</strong>, inviting you to <strong>explore </strong>its nooks and crannies. You\u2019ll <strong>find various objects </strong>scattered throughout, <strong>each with its own bit of dialogue to discover.</strong> As you wander through the hallways of the Komplex, you'll gradually pick up on its tune, and if you listen, the Sensoria will <strong>reveal its secrets </strong>to you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/969a22065df66c065cfddb1c482aa650.avif?t=1750623965\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/5376db31723113f1521c6023f7a59a2b.poster.avif?t=1750623965\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/5376db31723113f1521c6023f7a59a2b.apng?t=1750623965\" class=\"bb_img\" width=693 height=270 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique reality-bending mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep dark atmosphere built with love.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool RPG mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three separate skills to level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual, non-combat oriented horror experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living, breathing, world, with many secrets to be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many items to find within the Komplex.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-Linear gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-ended puzzle design with focus on intuitive solutions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920940/extras/ea0249b1f9a5a0653e21c3ab663d6a6e.webp?t=1750623965\" width=693 height=48 /></span></p>",
